{{also|trommel}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From late {{inh|de|gmh|trummel}}, diminutive of {{inh|de|goh|trumme}}, probably of {{onomatopoeic|de|title=imitative}} origin. Compare {{m|de|trommeln}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈtʁɔml̩/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Trommel.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f}}

# [[drum]] (musical instrument)
# drum-shaped part of a machine
#: {{ux|de|Waschmaschinen'''trommel'''|washing machine '''drum'''}}
#: {{ux|de|Brems'''trommel'''|brake '''drum'''}}
## (firearms) [[cylinder]] of a revolver

